-3bkz0c_round2.md (5-judge witness table, 7/7 live-plant proof, 27-row mutant table, residue table, AC mapping) + updated TASK-260830-3bkz0c_boundary.md. Follow-up TASK-260906-33xcnc created and referenced.\\n- GATES: `go test ./... -count=1 -p 2` exit 0 (19 pkgs), environ `-race` exit 0, cover 89.8%, `go vet ./...` + `GOOS=windows go vet` (3 pkgs) exit 0, gofmt clean, `tracecheck` exit 0 (94 cases, unchanged), `go build ./...` exit 0.\\n- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off to review (review/landing are orchestrator steps).\\n\\n### 1347 — Shared-environment boundary leaf: one library plus fail-closed agreement battery\\n- SCOPE: TASK-260830-3bkz0c (third/final leaf of STORY-260830-3drr2m). New package `internal/environ` (decode.go, tuple.go, observation.go, doc.go): single strict-frame decoder with string-walk surrogate semantics, rune measure, env-id/SemVer/arch grammars, exact six-member Tuple, §10.8.1 Environment Observation reusing the tuple model. Battery: census, frame/measure/tuple/identity agreement, observation. Frozen `sessadapter`/`dirnode` production untouched. Commit afdba1d (signed), PR #35 published.\\n- FINDING: sessadapter+dirnode raw-scan surrogate gates REFUSE wire bodies carrying literal backslash-u text (`cursor` value `\\\\ud800` text) while environ+provhost+canonicaljson string-walk gates ACCEPT — proven via DecodeTuple/CheckScanRequest/Canonicalize. sessadapter `TestSurrogateGateAgreesWithCanonicalJSON` is one-directional (`!localRefuses && sharedRefuses`) and hides exactly this class. Ledgered in frame_agreement_test.go; unifying the frozen scanners is the recorded follow-up.\\n- FINDING: truncated/malformed escapes refuse at the surrogate arm (raw scan) vs the syntax arm (string walk); wrong identity schema/version refuses at the member arm (provhost) vs the dispatch registry (canonicaljson). Same verdicts, different arms — ledgered per-judge, not papered over.\\n- FINDING: battery caught its author's parity error — run-3 backslashes (`\\\\\\\\\\\\ud800`) are a real lone escape (odd runs escape, even runs quote), not divergence; row corrected to all-refuse before green.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 9312,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2328,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
