xample \\\"db_password\\\") are not matched: the corpus arm covers secret\\n36:var sensitiveKeyNames = map[string]bool{\\n42:\\t\\\"oauth_token\\\": true, \\\"passphrase\\\": true, \\\"password\\\": true,\\n61://  3. sensitive key=value pairs: key=, key:, key =, or \\\"key\\\": \\\" shapes\\n62://     whose key exactly matches sensitiveKeyNames (case-insensitively)\\n71:// idempotent: its markers contain no sensitive key shape, so rescanning\\n140:// redactSensitivePairs masks values of exact sensitive keys in key=value,\\n172:// mergeBareKeyChunks joins a bare sensitive-key chunk with a following\\n191:// isBareSensitiveKey reports whether the chunk is exactly a sensitive key\\n===\\n=== RUN   TestTmpRedactProbe\\nin=\\\"password=hunter2\\\" out=\\\"password=[redacted]\\\"\\nin=\\\"api_key=[REDACTED]\\\" out=\\\"api_key=[redacted]]\\\"\\nin=\\\"plain hello\\\" out=\\\"plain hello\\\"\\nin=\\\"\\\" out=\\\"\\\"\\nin=\\\"-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\\\\nMIIB\\\\n-----END RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\\\" out=\\\"[redacted private key block]\\\"\\nIsEnvName empty=false 1bad=false AX_FOO=true\\n--- PASS: TestTmpRedactProbe (0.00s)\\nPASS\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/secconftest\\t0.548s\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1174,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 294,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
